    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kindergarten of hell: A childlike terror </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong>: Dive into the heart of horror in Kindergarten of Hell, a horror adventure game where the nightmare takes on childlike allusions. You play a detective, investigating a mysterious disappearance in a seemingly innocent nursery. But behind the pastel walls and seemingly harmless toys lurks a twisted, monstrous reality. Mysterious creatures, from the childhood imagination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Kindergarten of Hell combines exploration, puzzle solving and the course </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winding</strong> <strong>Journey</strong>: Navigate through the labyrinthine corridors of the daycare, each more terrifying than the previous. Classrooms transformed into torture chambers, a playground haunted by menacing shadows, and a canteen where the day\u2019s meal is an unspeakable horror await you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Macabre puzzles</strong>: Solve twisted puzzles, inspired by children's games, but perverted and morbid. Clues are hidden in unexpected places, and their discovery will not be without danger. Get ready to face your own warped childhood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong>: The atmosphere of the game is designed to immerse you in a constant discomfort. The graphics, stylized yet horrific, accentuate the contrast between the innocent appearance of the school and the monstrous reality that lurks there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong>: You will meet unreassuring pets</p>",
